{"id": "e1fc6ca7-ae53-411b-a647-095aee2ef66a", "slug": "synapse-data-orchestration", "title": "Synapse — Data Orchestration", "description": "Synapse Data Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Synapse — Data Orchestration\"\ndescription: \"Synapse Data Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#06B6D4\"\n  secondary: \"#050505\"\n  accent: \"#2DD4BF\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#EDEDED\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"15px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Synapse — Data Orchestration\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 21; favorites: 4; remixes: 1.\nTags: login, animated, threejs, security, input, validation, effect.\n## Overview\nSynapse Data Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\n\nSynapse Platform Orchestration Security Company Sign in Deploy Now Synapse Engine v2.0 Live Fluid intelligence for your data infrastructure. Unify your fragmented streams. Our autonomous orchestration layer automaticall…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Fluid intelligence for your data infrastructure.; System Telemetry; Architected for scale. Built for speed.; Schema-less Ingestion; Sub-millisecond Routing; Immutable Audit Trails.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #06B6D4, secondary #050505, accent #2DD4BF, background #050505, surface #EDEDED, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"scroll-smooth\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Synapse — Data Orchestration</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #050505;\n            color: #ededed;\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n        }\n\n        /* Border Gradients Base */\n        .gradient-border {\n            position: relative;\n            background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, rgba(255,255,255,0.1), rgba(255,255,255,0.02));\n            padding: 1px;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n        }\n        .gradient-border > div {\n            background-color: #0a0a0a;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n            height: 100%;\n            width: 100%;\n        }\n\n        /* Chart Animations */\n        .path-draw {\n            stroke-dasharray: 1000;\n            stroke-dashoffset: 1000;\n            animation: drawLine 3s ease-out forwards;\n        }\n        @keyframes drawLine { to { stroke-dashoffset: 0; } }\n\n        .area-fade {\n            opacity: 0;\n            animation: fadeArea 2s ease-out 0.5s forwards;\n        }\n        @keyframes fadeArea { to { opacity: 1; } }\n\n        .pulse-dot {\n            animation: pulseDot 2s infinite;\n        }\n        @keyframes pulseDot {\n            0% { transform: scale(0.95); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.7); }\n            70% { transform: scale(1); box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(45, 212, 191, 0); }\n            100% { transform: scale(0.95); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(45, 212, 191, 0); }\n        }\n\n        /* Flow Wires */\n        .wire-dot {\n            offset-path: path('M0,10 L100,10 C150,10 150,50 200,50 L300,50');\n            animation: moveDot 3s linear infinite;\n        }\n        @keyframes moveDot {\n            0% { offset-distance: 0%; opacity: 0;}\n            10% { opacity: 1;}\n            90% { opacity: 1;}\n            100% { offset-distance: 100%; opacity: 0;}\n        }\n\n        /* Hide scrollbar for clean dashboard look */\n        .no-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }\n        .no-scrollbar { -ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"selection:bg-cyan-500/30 selection:text-cyan-100 overflow-x-hidden\">\n\n    <!-- Fixed Nav -->\n    <nav class=\"fixed top-0 inset-x-0 z-50 border-b border-white/5 bg-[#050505]/70 backdrop-blur-md\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-[90rem] mx-auto px-6 h-14 flex items-center justify-between\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-white font-medium text-sm tracking-tight\">\n                <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded bg-gradient-to-tr from-cyan-500 to-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(6,182,212,0.4)]\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:slash-square-linear\" class=\"text-white text-sm\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                Synapse\n            </a>\n\n            <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-6 text-xs font-medium text-neutral-400\">\n                <a href=\"#platform\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Platform</a>\n                <a href=\"#orchestration\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Orchestration</a>\n                <a href=\"#security\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Security</a>\n                <a href=\"#company\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Company</a>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hidden sm:block text-xs font-medium text-neutral-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Sign in</a>\n                <button class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-black bg-white rounded-md hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-colors\">\n                    Deploy Now\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Hero Section with Canvas Rain -->\n    <section class=\"relative min-h-[120vh] pt-32 pb-20 overflow-hidden bg-[#050505]\" id=\"hero\">\n        <!-- Interactive Rain Canvas -->\n        <canvas id=\"rainCanvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-20 pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen\"></canvas>\n\n        <!-- Ambient Background Glows -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/4 w-[40rem] h-[30rem] bg-cyan-900/20 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-1/4 w-[30rem] h-[30rem] bg-blue-900/20 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"max-w-[90rem] mx-auto px-6 relative z-10\">\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-start\">\n\n                <!-- Left Copy -->\n                <div class=\"lg:col-span-5 pt-12 lg:pt-24 lg:sticky lg:top-24\">\n                    <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-cyan-500/20 bg-cyan-500/5 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-medium mb-6\">\n                        <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 animate-pulse\"></span>\n                        Synapse Engine v2.0 Live\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.1] mb-6 reveal-text\">\n                        Fluid intelligence for your data infrastructure.\n                    </h1>\n\n                    <p class=\"text-base text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-md reveal-text\">\n                        Unify your fragmented streams. Our autonomous orchestration layer automatically routes, processes, and structures data with zero latency overhead.\n                    </p>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 reveal-text\">\n                        <button class=\"px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-[#050505] bg-white rounded-lg hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]\">\n                            Start Building\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white border border-white/10 rounded-lg hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-circle-linear\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                            Watch Demo\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Right Dashboard Interface -->\n                <div class=\"lg:col-span-7 relative mt-12 lg:mt-0\">\n                    <div class=\"gradient-border rounded-2xl shadow-2xl shadow-black/80 rain-surface\" id=\"main-dash\">\n                        <div class=\"bg-[#0a0a0a] rounded-[15px] overflow-hidden flex flex-col min-h-[700px] border border-white/5\">\n\n                            <!-- Dash Header -->\n                            <div class=\"h-12 border-b border-white/5 flex items-center justify-between px-4 bg-[#0d0d0d]\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                    <div class=\"flex gap-1.5\">\n                                        <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-700\"></div>\n                                        <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-700\"></div>\n                                        <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-700\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"h-4 w-[1px] bg-white/10 mx-2\"></div>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 font-medium\">project / global-routing</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-neutral-400\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bell-linear\" class=\"text-sm hover:text-white cursor-pointer\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-neutral-800 to-neutral-900 border border-white/10\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Dash Body Split -->\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-1 overflow-hidden\">\n\n                                <!-- Dash Sidebar -->\n                                <div class=\"w-48 border-r border-white/5 bg-[#0a0a0a] p-3 flex flex-col gap-1 hidden sm:flex\">\n                                    <div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-600 font-medium mb-2 px-2 mt-2\">Overview</div>\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-1.5 rounded-md bg-white/5 text-white text-xs font-medium border border-white/5\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:widget-linear\"></iconify-icon> Dashboard\n                                    </a>\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-1.5 rounded-md text-neutral-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/5 text-xs font-medium transition-colors\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:routing-2-linear\"></iconify-icon> Pipelines\n                                    </a>\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-1.5 rounded-md text-neutral-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/5 text-xs font-medium transition-colors\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-square-linear\"></iconify-icon> Compute\n                                    </a>\n\n                                    <div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-600 font-medium mb-2 px-2 mt-6\">Resources</div>\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-1.5 rounded-md text-neutral-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/5 text-xs font-medium transition-colors\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:database-linear\"></iconify-icon> Storage\n                                    </a>\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-1.5 rounded-md text-neutral-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/5 text-xs font-medium transition-colors\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-keyhole-linear\"></iconify-icon> Secrets\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <!-- Dash Main Content -->\n                                <div class=\"flex-1 p-5 bg-[#080808] overflow-y-auto no-scrollbar relative\">\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\">\n                                        <div>\n                                            <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white tracking-tight\">System Telemetry</h2>\n                                            <p class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 mt-0.5\">Real-time throughput and agent status.</p>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                            <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-400/10 px-2 py-1 rounded border border-emerald-400/20\">\n                                                <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 pulse-dot\"></span> Live\n                                            </span>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n\n                                    <!-- Metrics Grid -->\n                                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-4\">\n                                        <div class=\"gradient-border rounded-lg rain-surface\">\n                                            <div class=\"p-3\">\n                                                <div class=\"text-[10px] text-neutral-500 font-medium mb-1 flex items-center gap-1\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-line-up-linear\"></iconify-icon> Req / Sec</div>\n                                                <div class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-white\">24.5k</div>\n                                                <div class=\"text-[10px] text-cyan-400 mt-1\">↑ 12% vs last hour</div>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"gradient-border rounded-lg rain-surface\">\n                                            <div class=\"p-3\">\n                                                <div class=\"text-[10px] text-neutral-500 font-medium mb-1 flex items-center gap-1\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:stopwatch-linear\"></iconify-icon> Avg Latency</div>\n                                                <div class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-white\">42<span class=\"text-sm text-neutral-500\">ms</span></div>\n                                                <div class=\"text-[10px] text-emerald-400 mt-1\">↓ 3ms optimal</div>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"gradient-border rounded-lg rain-surface\">\n                                            <div class=\"p-3\">\n                                                <div class=\"text-[10px] text-neutral-500 font-medium mb-1 flex items-center gap-1\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\"></iconify-icon> Active Nodes</div>\n                                                <div class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-white\">128</div>\n                                                <div class=\"text-[10px] text-neutral-500 mt-1\">Scaling up</div>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n\n                                    <!-- Main Chart -->\n                                    <div class=\"gradient-border rounded-xl mb-4 rain-surface\">\n                                        <div class=\"p-4 relative\">\n                                            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center mb-4\">\n                                                <div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-neutral-300\">Throughput Volume</div>\n                                                <div class=\"flex gap-2\">\n                                                    <span class=\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/5 text-neutral-400\">1H</span>\n                                                    <span class=\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-cyan-500/20 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-300\">24H</span>\n                                                </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <div class=\"h-32 w-full relative\">\n                                                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 100\" class=\"w-full h-full overflow-visible preserve-aspect-ratio-none\">\n                                                    <defs>\n                                                        <linearGradient id=\"area-grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n                                                            <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#06b6d4\" stop-opacity=\"0.2\"/>\n                                                            <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#06b6d4\" stop-opacity=\"0\"/>\n                                                        </linearGradient>\n                                                    </defs>\n                                                    <path d=\"M0,80 C40,70 80,90 120,50 C160,10 200,60 240,40 C280,20 320,50 360,20 L400,30 L400,100 L0,100 Z\" fill=\"url(#area-grad)\" class=\"area-fade\"/>\n                                                    <path d=\"M0,80 C40,70 80,90 120,50 C160,10 200,60 240,40 C280,20 320,50 360,20 L400,30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#06b6d4\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"path-draw\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n                                                </svg>\n                                                <!-- Grid lines -->\n                                                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 border-t border-b border-white/5 flex flex-col justify-between pointer-events-none\">\n                                                    <div class=\"h-[1px] w-full bg-white/5\"></div>\n                                                    <div class=\"h-[1px] w-full bg-white/5\"></div>\n                                                </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n\n                                    <!-- Bottom Row -->\n                                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n                                        <!-- Agent Status -->\n                                        <div class=\"gradient-border rounded-xl rain-surface\">\n                                            <div class=\"p-4\">\n                                                <div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-neutral-300 mb-3\">Agent Swarm Status</div>\n                                                <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n                                                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs\">\n                                                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-neutral-400\">\n                                                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:database-linear\" class=\"text-blue-400\"></iconify-icon> Data Ingestion\n                                                        </div>\n                                                        <div class=\"text-emerald-400 font-medium\">Running</div>\n                                                    </div>\n                                                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs\">\n                                                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-neutral-400\">\n                                                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:filters-linear\" class=\"text-purple-400\"></iconify-icon> Sanitization\n                                                        </div>\n                                                        <div class=\"text-emerald-400 font-medium\">Running</div>\n                                                    </div>\n                                                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs\">\n                                                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-neutral-400\">\n                                                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:map-arrow-up-linear\" class=\"text-amber-400\"></iconify-icon> Vector Mapping\n                                                        </div>\n                                                        <div class=\"text-neutral-500 font-medium\">Idle</div>\n                                                    </div>\n                                                </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n\n                                        <!-- Flow Visualization -->\n                                        <div class=\"gradient-border rounded-xl rain-surface\">\n                                            <div class=\"p-4 flex flex-col h-full\">\n                                                <div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-neutral-300 mb-auto\">Topology</div>\n                                                <div class=\"relative h-16 w-full mt-4 flex items-center justify-between px-2\">\n                                                    <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center relative z-10 text-neutral-400\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-path-linear\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                                                    <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg border border-cyan-500/30 bg-cyan-500/10 flex items-center justify-center relative z-10 text-cyan-400 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(6,182,212,0.2)]\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-bolt-linear\"></iconify-icon></div>\n                                                    <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center relative z-10 text-neutral-400\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:database-linear\"></iconify-icon></div>\n\n                                                    <!-- Connecting line -->\n                                                    <div class=\"absolute left-6 right-6 h-[1px] bg-white/10 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-0 overflow-hidden\">\n                                                        <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-cyan-500 to-transparent w-1/2 -translate-x-full animate-[scan_2s_linear_infinite]\"></div>\n                                                    </div>\n                                                </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n\n\n\n    <!-- GSAP & Canvas Scripts -->\n    <script>\n        // --- GSAP Masked Reveal ---\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-text').forEach((element) => {\n            // Split text into words, wrap in masks\n            const words = element.innerText.split(' ');\n            element.innerHTML = '';\n\n            words.forEach((word) => {\n                const mask = document.createElement('span');\n                mask.className = 'inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom mr-[0.25em]';\n\n                const innerWord = document.createElement('span');\n                innerWord.className = 'inline-block translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform';\n                innerWord.innerText = word;\n\n                mask.appendChild(innerWord);\n                element.appendChild(mask);\n            });\n\n            // Animate\n            gsap.to(element.querySelectorAll('span > span'), {\n                y: 0,\n                duration: 0.8,\n                stagger: 0.02,\n                ease: \"power3.out\",\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: element,\n                    start: \"top 85%\",\n                    toggleActions: \"play none none none\"\n                }\n            });\n        });\n\n        // --- Interactive Rain Canvas ---\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('rainCanvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d', { alpha: true });\n        let width, height;\n        let drops = [];\n        let splashes = [];\n\n        // Define collision surfaces based on DOM elements\n        let surfaces = [];\n\n        function resize() {\n            width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n            height = canvas.height = document.getElementById('hero').offsetHeight;\n            updateSurfaces();\n        }\n\n        function updateSurfaces() {\n            surfaces = [];\n            const elements = document.querySelectorAll('.rain-surface');\n            const heroRect = document.getElementById('hero').getBoundingClientRect();\n\n            elements.forEach(el => {\n                const rect = el.getBoundingClientRect();\n                surfaces.push({\n                    x: rect.left,\n                    width: rect.width,\n                    y: rect.top - heroRect.top, // relative to canvas\n                });\n            });\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n\n        // Track mouse for wind\n        let mouseX = 0;\n        let wind = 0;\n        window.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n            mouseX = e.clientX;\n            // Simple wind calculation based on mouse position relative to center\n            wind = ((mouseX / window.innerWidth) - 0.5) * 2;\n        });\n\n        class Drop {\n            constructor() {\n                this.x = Math.random() * width;\n                this.y = Math.random() * -height;\n                this.length = Math.random() * 20 + 10;\n                this.speed = Math.random() * 5 + 8;\n                this.color = `rgba(6, 182, 212, ${Math.random() * 0.4 + 0.1})`; // Cyan tinted\n                this.thickness = Math.random() * 1.5 + 0.5;\n            }\n\n            fall() {\n                this.y += this.speed;\n                this.x += wind * 2;\n\n                // Wrap horizontally\n                if (this.x > width) this.x = 0;\n                if (this.x < 0) this.x = width;\n\n                // Check collisions with defined surfaces\n                let hit = false;\n                for (let s of surfaces) {\n                    if (this.x > s.x && this.x < s.x + s.width && this.y + this.length > s.y && this.y < s.y + 10) {\n                        hit = true;\n                        createSplash(this.x, s.y);\n                        this.reset();\n                        break;\n                    }\n                }\n\n                // Floor collision\n                if (!hit && this.y > height) {\n                    this.reset();\n                }\n            }\n\n            reset() {\n                this.y = Math.random() * -100 - 100;\n                this.x = Math.random() * width;\n                this.speed = Math.random() * 5 + 8;\n            }\n\n            draw() {\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.moveTo(this.x, this.y);\n                ctx.lineTo(this.x - (wind*2), this.y + this.length);\n                ctx.strokeStyle = this.color;\n                ctx.lineWidth = this.thickness;\n                ctx.lineCap = 'round';\n                ctx.stroke();\n            }\n        }\n\n        class Splash {\n            constructor(x, y) {\n                this.x = x;\n                this.y = y;\n                this.vx = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 4;\n                this.vy = Math.random() * -3 - 1;\n                this.life = 1;\n                this.size = Math.random() * 1.5 + 0.5;\n            }\n\n            update() {\n                this.x += this.vx + (wind * 0.5);\n                this.y += this.vy;\n                this.vy += 0.2; // gravity\n                this.life -= 0.05;\n            }\n\n            draw() {\n                ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(6, 182, 212, ${this.life})`;\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.arc(this.x, this.y, this.size, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                ctx.fill();\n            }\n        }\n\n        function createSplash(x, y) {\n            let numParticles = Math.floor(Math.random() * 3) + 2;\n            for (let i = 0; i < numParticles; i++) {\n                splashes.push(new Splash(x, y));\n            }\n        }\n\n        function initRain() {\n            resize();\n            for (let i = 0; i < 150; i++) {\n                drops.push(new Drop());\n            }\n            animateRain();\n        }\n\n        function animateRain() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n            drops.forEach(drop => {\n                drop.fall();\n                drop.draw();\n            });\n\n            for (let i = splashes.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n                let splash = splashes[i];\n                splash.update();\n                splash.draw();\n                if (splash.life <= 0) {\n                    splashes.splice(i, 1);\n                }\n            }\n\n            // Wind decay\n            wind *= 0.98;\n\n            requestAnimationFrame(animateRain);\n        }\n\n        // Initialize after fonts/layout load to get correct bounding boxes\n        window.onload = () => {\n            initRain();\n            // Re-calc surfaces occasionally just in case of layout shifts\n            setInterval(updateSurfaces, 2000);\n        };\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "synapse-data-orchestration.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/synapse-data-orchestration.jpg", "source_name": "synapse-data-orchestration-DESIGN.md", "views": 27, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-06-21T11:39:54.279152+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T13:32:38.710733+00:00"}